<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>KARACHI, Mar 4 - Eight vessels waiting off port, six fertiliser vessels, the first waiting 15 days, and two oil tankers, the first waiting eight days. Four vessels waiting off port for their own reasons.</p>
</text>
